{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13220990","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13220990","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1322099001:1":{"text":"吾爱，我们找到了戴蒙，他还交到了朋友，你应该开心才对。","source_cn":"吾爱，我们找到了戴蒙，他还交到了朋友，你应该开心才对。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D2DEA27DF4B0047","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322099002:1":{"text":"可是……","source_cn":"可是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC4087633475D981","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322099003:1":{"text":"柳博米尔先生说得对。是我们错了，我们一直把戴蒙当成病弱的、会被人欺负的孩子……","source_cn":"柳博米尔先生说得对。是我们错了，我们一直把戴蒙当成病弱...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B23906598AF38F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322099004:1":{"text":"难道……难道他不是吗？","source_cn":"难道……难道他不是吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x629DDEE53BA250CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1322099005:1":{"text":"吾爱，他不是。我一生都在研究灵魂、生命和死亡，我亲手给了他第二次生命，可我却没能仔细地了解过我的儿子，了解他灵魂深处的坚韧和强大。","source_cn":"吾爱，他不是。我一生都在研究灵魂、生命和死亡，我亲手给...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD59E621600F897D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1322099006:1":{"text":"我对他的认知还始终停留在过去的时光——在那段日子里，我甚至没有好好陪伴过他。多可笑啊！","source_cn":"我对他的认知还始终停留在过去的时光——在那段日子里，我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58FA77B87718FA94","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1322099007:1":{"text":"成为亡灵就是“新生”。你在成为亡灵之后很快就掌握了亡灵法术，可戴蒙却还在生病、咳嗽……不，不该是这样的！","source_cn":"成为亡灵就是“新生”。你在成为亡灵之后很快就掌握了亡灵...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD8FBD967930D7B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1322099008:1":{"text":"我们将他挡在身后，却忘了他已经获得新生……是我们过度的关爱才让他始终一副病容，让他没能认识到自己的改变，无法掌握新的能力。","source_cn":"我们将他挡在身后，却忘了他已经获得新生……是我们过度的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14B3BFCA54FC6882","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1322099009:1":{"text":"仔细看看戴蒙吧，吾爱……看看我们的儿子。他的确长大了。","source_cn":"仔细看看戴蒙吧，吾爱……看看我们的儿子。他的确长大了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E00C275F21D9A8F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1322099010:1":{"text":"我们……我们真的做错了吗？戴蒙……","source_cn":"我们……我们真的做错了吗？戴蒙……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD5BFD54C83E2E5D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_t